{"id":1494,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年6月3日，中共中北大学马克思主义学院委员会第二次党员大会在科艺苑学术报告厅隆重举行。大会由院党委副书记李庆乐主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM46YkMzQko7lYM48-PL8LioRrVMzL84oRvPoRTkUlCZMm90gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2LSyiLkhRUmnVUzUaMzL4Ul-Poz9iM4Q7nmAVnNUPMmMFnmUPLlQ2L4MFLzNPnzLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FF150CB4EA40533AB198576DF8EFD163/F411FF33/191E3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL4UY8UzvsMm62o4znVL8LYo77YLRv8DMzNiLlLbozCPL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRUSyan1ysLmfVMz9io7LsnNV2LRNZMlV2Um9ZL4rfM7VFL8V7oRGaM7MFLmGDnR-ZgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUlrYVUm9bU4-iL4mGPnzUZMm7so7C8DL8U8Ullsn7UsMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVoSyDU1hRUN78ozQ7UNV2nzNboRv4nm7DM8-bM4-8MRWFMmLbM8Q7LNnFLzNbnRNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AE96BCBA496DBAFE99873F167B972442/6397FD2D/199D9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PU47YZMRn7nlCsM47MfUmGanRLaozC8aMzLPM8lZL7CZUll0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZokhfLSyDM47YnmTfUzVVn7-iLRNiM774Uln7o7n2nNMFLRN4UzMko7rFM49YLNQ7gjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>大会在庄严的《中华人民共和国国歌》声中正式开幕。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PnmlYbUmA2nzUso4z7PnzA7LlCDnRU8PLRG8oR98MRWknNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhRokyDoSy8MR-YMmGbLRNbMmM2LR6RMzlPM46RnRTfnlnFU4r2nzv4M7QFLz-4n7LJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4C869442260909963F07C55177CD9AED/C5FE734F/123DC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLzAYfM4UanR6RU4z9sMmQfL7QkMm-8sUmrVUlQ2LN-YnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVMYyYnSyZoR-ioRARL8r7ollYn7LDL4UZnm9ZoRnVMRAFMmvsoR7snzQFoRCPLmn7gjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>赵笑蕾同志宣读了中共中北大学委员会《关于同意召开中国共产党中北大学马克思主义学院委员会党员大会的批复》。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLlUYbUm74nRffM4mLZUz78U4G8L7C8aMR-aM462ol-sU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0MSysLky8n1hkoz74MzvZM8r7Lm7ZM4NaL7liU8WfMmNYnR6Fn7LsUzLanRfFLzLbnR-Jv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5704FB9135787ED2187900E5CBA692D7/DC7A30D0/139D2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PMzUYiLmCanRLYn4NWfozrkLRlDUzN88nmGiL4vinRMkUN70gihFp2hmCIa0MYybnkhkUYh2nz7DnmrRL4M7L8nRMmT2ozVfMzNsUzA7oR6FnmvbLNl8MRVFoRlYLlLbgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>段义权同志代表学院第一届党委向大会作了工作报告，全面总结了过去的工作成绩与经验，并对未来工作提出了规划建议。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PU49YZLR6VL8V7M44ARLNCbUlUYLmN8Zol-YUzNsoll4UzN0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h7n1hRLYhfU4UbU8-iL4M2MR9DUzrRnzN8LR7bn7nfMRTFL4VVL474M7rFLzUZLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BDFC3AC49CB533F486A5CE94019DDA49/31E3134E/14802\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PollYZLm6RU47so4zU4LRUZnN7aMmf8fnN7bUzV7M4LDM4-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkUYhVLShVLmCsM4-ZU467Lzr7nN7YnzLDMmlYMzNYM4nFUz-DLR9PnlVFoRLsU8MRgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>郭玲霞同志代表第一届党委作了《党费收缴、使用和管理情况的报告》，向全体党员报告了党费收支的详细情况。</p><p>会议审议并表决通过了《中共中北大学马克思主义学院第二届委员会选举办法（草案）》，表决通过了监票人名单，宣布了计票人名单。大会严格按照选举办法进行了投票、计票工作。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8WYkM474M4TRn4RCaU8n7nRGaLlQ87L878oRrkLl7Po7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysnkyYLYy4LRQ2UNVfLl7sL8Canzv8nRW7MRv8nRrfMNrFLmvPM8W7oRVFMl7sn7UJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E7D23306FBAA1A73F0E74D2D474D5A6E/2717BD81/5A7DD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8WYkM474M4TRn4RCaU8n7nRGaLlQ87L878oRrkLl7Po7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysnkyYLYy4LRQ2UNVfLl7sL8Canzv8nRW7MRv8nRrfMNrFLmvPM8W7oRVFMl7sn7UJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>经无记名投票，大会选举产生了中共中北大学马克思主义学院第二届委员会委员。</p><p>大会圆满完成了各项预定议程，会议在庄严的《国际歌》声中闭幕。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PMmNYPU8V7nzAfM4mGYU8n2L7nRnz98aMRCsnmr2L4NZMRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USh2oSyan1yPMNr7UlWknlU8nNnVM4MVM7L4o7rRLRMkL7VFMzWknRVkUlWFLl7iLllJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AF90F16EDABBED4FDE73E4C38EC03B0A/52BD1BAB/1A51E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLRUYiL4-sLlLsL44AkLRlDozW2L7-8bM7rkLNLinz6fMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yZoSybMShfUl-ZUmNYo7UbnlCiolQkoRCYMmGDLmCDLzrFLzrkLz7PUmAFolrRnmQ7gjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzG4Mky8ozvsgtA8pUicc&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png\"></p><p>本次党员大会是一次团结、民主、务实、奋进的大会，为马克思主义学院未来一个时期的发展奠定了坚实的组织基础和政治保障。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM46YkMzQko7lYM48-PL8LioRrVMzL84oRvPoRTkUlCZMm90gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2LSyiLkhRUmnVUzUaMzL4Ul-Poz9iM4Q7nmAVnNUPMmMFnmUPLlQ2L4MFLzNPnzLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRL8g4UbM4vJqdinx&oid=1579047909&tid=1034&nid=4977&e=.png"}